    "title": "Crime Stoppers: Help solve crimes in the capital area - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Shajaka Shelton ,\n46 minutes ago\nLANSING, Mich. (WLNS) — This week on Crime Stoppers, police need your help tracking down $7,000 in stolen goods and identifying someone involved in a retail fraud.\nIf you have information regarding the cases below, call Crime Stoppers of Mid-Michigan at (517) 483-STOP. You can remain anonymous.\nThose who contact Crime Stoppers with information can receive an award of up to $1,000.",
